{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/996544-1e-question-about-armor-defense-and-i-can-not-possibly-be-understanding-it","id":996544,"title":"[1E] Question about Armor, Defense and I can not possibly be understanding it?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-11-01T05:55:27-07:00","id":996544,"title":"[1E] Question about Armor, Defense and I can not possibly be understanding it?","content":"So for reasons I joined a 1e game and it's my first time every playing the first edition of what is now Chronicles of Darkness. I have played the current game and love it's rule set so I figured 1st couldn't be that much different. I'm looking at armor for my Summer Changeling hitman and after glancing over the combat rules looking at things and I notice that weapons add dice to the attack roll, okay I can understand that. Armor adds to defense. Okay I can understand that. I look at Flack jacket and Kevlar Vest and with the flack jacket's -1 to defense isn't it just a freaking Kevlar Vest? I mean you subtract 1 from both it's numbers and you get the same value as a kevlar vest which has -0 defense penalty. Am I missing something here?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-01T07:11:42-07:00","id":996570,"title":"","content":"There are a couple of things here:<br /> -You don't get defence against firearms, that's the big thing, but I'm not sure if that's relevant here.<br /> -Armour is actually seperate from defence.<br /> -If I remember right your defence goes down with every sucessive attack in a round, whilst your armour is consistent.<br /> -flank and rear attacks don't automatically get defence.<br /> -Armour allows for all-out attacks where you drop your defence in exchange for extra attack dice. At least in 1e that was a fairly common tactic for Magi.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-01T12:24:28-07:00","id":996746,"title":"","content":"Yeah, in 1e armor reduces the attacker's dice pool, which makes it functionally similar to, but not exactly the same as, Defense. Which means even if your Defense is reduced for any reason, your armor still remains as a penalty to attackers' dice pools.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-01T15:00:24-07:00","id":996826,"title":"","content":"Thank you that answers my questions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}